  "claim": "The star of Somebody's Daughter also starred in the film that Jim Moody played Arnie in. He also had a role in the TV series Barney Miller.",
  "evidencia": "Page: D.C. Cab. Sentence: D.C. Cab (also known as Street Fight) is a 1983 American comedy film, starring Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, and Whitman Mayo.\nPage: Max Gail. Sentence: He most notably portrayed the role of Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom \"Barney Miller\".\nPage: Jim Moody (actor). Sentence: Jim starred in the 1983 comedy film \"D.C. Cab\" as Arnie, a member of the rival cab company, Emerald Cab.\nPage: Somebody's Daughter. Sentence: Somebody's Daughter is a 1992 television film starring Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Max Gail and Richard Lineback.",
