        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, Whitman Mayo, Jim Moody, Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Richard Lineback\n- Products: D.C. Cab, Street Fight, Barney Miller, Somebody's Daughter\n- Roles: Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz, Arnie\n- Organizations: Emerald Cab\n\nFacts:\n- D.C. Cab, also known as Street Fight, is a 1983 American comedy film starring Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Mr. T, Charlie Barnett, Gary Busey, Marsha Warfield, and Whitman Mayo.\n- Jim Moody starred in the 1983 comedy film D.C. Cab as Arnie, a member of the rival cab company Emerald Cab.\n- Somebody's Daughter is a 1992 television film starring Nicollette Sheridan, Nick Mancuso, Boyd Kestner, Michael Cavanaugh, Max Gail, and Richard Lineback.\n- Max Gail is most notable for portraying Detective Stan \"Wojo\" Wojciehowicz on the television sitcom Barney Miller.",
